Zixi is a leading platform for secure, reliable, and low-latency video transport over IP networks. It ensures high-quality live video delivery by correcting packet loss and minimizing jitter, making it ideal for professional broadcast applications.
When used with Red5 Cloud, Zixi streams can be received directly via Zixi Broadcaster or Zixi Receiver. Once the stream enters Red5 Cloud, it can be transcoded, recorded, and delivered globally using protocols like WebRTC, HLS, and RTMP. This workflow enables high-quality contribution feeds from remote locations to be distributed at scale in real time.

